    "text": "Hot on the heels of Flight 15, SpaceX is prepping the next Starship fleet, including Booster 24 and Ship 42 for Flight 17, a mission that could become Starship’s historic debut from Pad 39A in Florida.\n\n➡️ youtu.be/4EmPnjjNKlQ",
